# Keep the Plugin Bundle image build context (packaging/grafana-plugins/
# Dockerfile, build from the repository root) to exactly what it copies: the
# vendored plugin sources and the logo the branding patch embeds. Everything
# else -- .git, generated credentials in deploy/compose/.env, the local Unity
# build/ -- stays out of the build context and out of `docker build` cache
# invalidations.
*
!vendor/
!vendor/grafana-plugins/
!vendor/grafana-plugins/**
!packaging/
!packaging/grafana-plugins/
!packaging/grafana-plugins/**
!openegiz_logo_dark.svg
